#: templates/landing.html:28
msgid ""
"\n"
"        Set your own strength goals and compete with friends of any level.\n"
"        Whether you're very strong or very beginner, everyone can enter the\n"
"        same challenge and chase their own personal best. Sound good? Go "
"get\n"
"        'em, champ!\n"
"        "
